summary:dance of death

the Olog-hai is not that bad, really it is good. find a nice room and lock the
door and do the dance of death. Be first of high-level with a powerful weapon 
and some quantity of food! Now hack up the Olog-hai but don't eat it. Hang
around till it return from the dead. Every so often it'll leave a gift with
its corpse. the gift item and about (400?) exp. per Olog-hai is what this dance
is after. 

